        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1590, Elbow Latch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Elbow Catch is an easy to install and simple way to secure one light weight door of a double door set commonly found on dressers, cabinets, window shutters, and many other places throughout your home. One door uses the elbow catch to secure the door and the second door is secured by a friction latch, magnetic latch, or cam lock.  To open both doors you first open the door without the elbow catch, then reach in behind the door to release the elbow catch.  The latch is made of cast aluminum. Choose from polished brass, polished chrome or satin chrome finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-1590-specifications.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"392\" height=\"160\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-jo 1590 Elbow Catch Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Don-Jo 1590 Elbow Catch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: .6\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1.333\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
